# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT SOURCE MATERIAL — DELIBERATELY NOT COMMITTED
#
# docs/examples/ holds Governance AI's own methodology and, critically, another
# client's board pack marked "Confidential". None of it is needed to build or
# run this project: the code consumes the structured transcription in
# content/, not the original .docx files.
#
# Do not remove this rule. If this repo is ever made public, these files must
# not be in its history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
